  "title": "Capital One Debuts Rare 30% Transfer Bonus to EVA Air",
  "summary": "Capital One is offering a 30% transfer bonus to EVA Air Infinity MileageLands through July 31, 2026, which improves the standard conversion rate to 975 airline miles per 1,000 Capital One miles. This rare promotion is highly useful for accessing exclusive Royal Laurel business class award space directly through EVA Air, though members should be mindful of a strict 36-month mileage expiration policy before finalizing any non-reversible transfers.",
